          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cb1f42423dfb448ee5bf8f4659b0eee2a4a32856",
          "message": "Generate Species from CIF  (#850)\n\n* Allow simultameous setup of Box and CellArray.\r\n\r\n* Don't remove Box/Cells on empty().\r\n\r\n* Allow removal of atoms from vector of indices.\r\n\r\n* Persist view style.\r\n\r\n* Add CIFAssembly model.\r\n\r\n* Add basic CIF import wizard.\r\n\r\n* Constify argument.\r\n\r\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Access to wizard page index.\r\n\r\n* Set space group (from id) externally.\r\n\r\n* Allow setting of atomtype at creation time.\r\n\r\n* Create supercell.\r\n\r\n* Fix calculation of bonding in a Species with a Box definition.\r\n\r\n* Fix tooltip return in torsion model.\r\n\r\n* Fix / ensure display of SpeciesIntra-focussed models.\r\n\r\n* Rename function to avoid confusion, and work on atom indices.\r\n\r\n* Don't use magic number.\r\n\r\n* Apply suggestions from code review\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Missing include.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
          "timestamp": "2021-11-17T09:38:51Z",
