          "id": "5b83758860319cbc7e23c3ec582370142180018b",
          "message": "Forcefield and SpeciesTab Fixes (#886)\n\n* Throw when a built-in forcefield fails to initialise correctly.\r\n\r\n* Tidy species intra models.\r\n\r\n* Track version of species in tab, and reset intra models when required.\r\n\r\n* Fix writing of intra params when a masterterm has no form, and always write form for local parameters.\r\n\r\n* Fix tooltip.\r\n\r\n* Fix error/warn symbols for total species charge.\r\n\r\n* Make sure dataModified() signal is emitted.\r\n\r\n* Fix improper searching to cover all possible permutations.",
