          "id": "2aa99b6d40441b31815a402d016b177aadcfefab",
          "message": "Remove list dependency from Procedure Node (#876)\n\n* Remove ListItem and added NodeRef type\r\n\r\nThis will not compile\r\n\r\n* Start using vectors and range based for loops\r\n\r\n* Builds, but crashes\r\n\r\n* Fix bug\r\n\r\n* Start parametersing NodeRef\r\n\r\n* WIP more type fixing\r\n\r\n* Remove desctructor from SelectProcedureNode\r\n\r\n* Builds\r\n\r\n* Actually include node type aliases in source control\r\n\r\n* Now shared_from_this in constructor\r\n\r\n* The root procedure needs to be in a shared pointer\r\n\r\n* Fix keyword retrieval in calculate_dangle\r\n\r\n* Builds without GUI\r\n\r\n* Fix formatting\r\n\r\n* enable allow for gui build\r\n\r\n* Completely delete the List template\r\n\r\n* Fix cn pointer reference\r\n\r\n* Update src/keywords/dynamicsitenodes.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/gui/models/procedureNodeModel.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Remove bits that snuck back in during the merge.\r\n\r\n* Fix formatting\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>",
