          "id": "a04d4d8b3090d855c5ad157fa640e885f54a7af4",
          "message": "Optimise species loading (#887)\n\n* Tidy ctors and allow public assignment of atoms.\r\n\r\n* Write vector sizes to input file, and resize vectors on read.\r\n\r\n* Check for existing terms when preallocating arrays, and tidy find functions.\r\n\r\n* Remove species parent_ from SpeciesAtom, update isotopologues where necessary.\r\n\r\n* Simplify term match comparisons, fix improper term matching.\r\n\r\n* Apply suggestions from code review\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Const references.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
