          "distinct": true,
          "id": "403a0529ee9d1db2aad771726f12c220bfaf5acf",
          "message": "Singularity no fork (#849)\n\n* Add singularity to pr artifacts\r\n\r\n* Lie to nix about having virtualisation on Azure\r\n\r\nWe only need the virtualisation at runtime, but singularity always\r\nchecks for it.\r\n\r\n* Increase singularity disk size\r\n\r\n* Give debugging information on the singularity build\r\n\r\n* Remove docker build - only singularity\r\n\r\nIf disk space is our issue, this might help with that.\r\n\r\n* Try and fix build caching on azure\r\n\r\n* Check cachix token\r\n\r\n* Try and fix CACHIX environment variable\r\n\r\n* Less on-the-nose name for cachix_token\r\n\r\n* Try and get azure to load the secret token\r\n\r\n* Remove interpolation\r\n\r\n* Azure secrets case sensitive?\r\n\r\n* Hard code token\r\n\r\nI'll need to delete this tonight\r\n\r\n* Link data for artifacts instead of copying\r\n\r\n* Maybe fix yaml secret issues finally?\r\n\r\n* The variables aren't loading again\r\n\r\n* Try again on checking the tokens\r\n\r\n* Dont' build anything - just show the token\r\n\r\n* Try string interpolation again\r\n\r\n* All caps token?\r\n\r\n* Try using a secure file on azure?\r\n\r\n* Dummy out code for auth test\r\n\r\n* Remove dhall.nix reference\r\n\r\n* Dummy out more code\r\n\r\n* Try a full build\r\n\r\n* Smaller disk size\r\n\r\n* Show free space\r\n\r\n* Don't compile qt environment for non-GUI packages\r\n\r\n* Clear nix cache before building singularity image\r\n\r\n* Remove build before clearing cache\r\n\r\n* Do we have space for just the singularity package?\r\n\r\n* Three stage build\r\n\r\n* Fix release build\r\n\r\n* Unique job names\r\n\r\n* Make a GUI release build\r\n\r\n* Don't try and build docker\r\n\r\n* Re-enable mac and windows builds\r\n\r\n* Move linux packaging into a template\r\n\r\n* Update packaging template to new directory\r\n\r\n* Move linux release build into template\r\n\r\n* Update release handling of linux\r\n\r\n* Don't build linux packages on PR\r\n\r\n* Enable continuous build\r\n\r\n* Don't push to cachix if export isn't enabled.",
          "timestamp": "2021-11-30T09:34:46Z",
