          "message": "Module data handling (#890)\n\n* Rename function for consistency.\r\n\r\n* Add ModuleLayerModel.\r\n\r\n* Overhaul LayerTab.\r\n\r\n* Model with dragdrop.\r\n\r\n* Add module palette model.\r\n\r\n* Allow drops from palette.\r\n\r\n* Remove defunct module chart and module list widgets.\r\n\r\n* Tidy up and relocate module search / creation.\r\n\r\n* Add model for vector of modules.\r\n\r\n* Fix writing of atom type vector.\r\n\r\n* Update module list when changing module status.\r\n\r\n* Fix unit tests following module naming changes.",
