          "message": "Keyword Saving (#907)\n\n* Write and reload input file to improve testing.\r\n\r\n* Add OptionalInteger keyword and widget.\r\n\r\n* Use optional-based keywords.\r\n\r\n* Remove KeywordBase::set_ and associated functions.\r\n\r\n* Let fmt decide on double precision.\r\n\r\n* Quote around configuration names.\r\n\r\n* Don't write file and format if no filename set.\r\n\r\n* Clear impropers.\r\n\r\n* Save inline valuestore data.\r\n\r\n* Space between keyword and data.\r\n\r\n* Explicitly name node in procedure, update test.\r\n\r\n* Tighten energy/force criteria.",
