          "distinct": true,
          "id": "f37064f243589d9e3c331d0db0fbbcab3e931391",
          "message": "Patch 12/2021 (#920)\n\n* Remove ability to calculate bonds from species viewer, as this will break EVERYTHING.\r\n\r\n* Update info frame point size in viewers so they're legible.\r\n\r\n* Mark overrides.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused generator group from SpeciesTab.\r\n\r\n* Use label for applied size factor value.\r\n\r\n* Fix info text.\r\n\r\n* Fix transitions between module control widgets.\r\n\r\n* Adjust main window margins.\r\n\r\n* Fix limit calculation for periodic species.\r\n\r\n* Don't add species if population is <= 0.\r\n\r\n* Don't try to set parameters vector if it wasn't provided.\r\n\r\n* Don't error and stop on missing file. Reposition module setUp().\r\n\r\n* Tidy recent files functions.\r\n\r\n* Don't enforce integer populations in Isotopologue.\r\n\r\n* Remove some redundant declarations.\r\n\r\n* Remove Q_DECLARE_* uses.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused includes.\r\n\r\n* Disable simulation menu when using Run For.\r\n\r\n* Fix crash from bad keyword use in EPSRModule.\r\n\r\n* Fix graphing in EPSRModule.\r\n\r\n* Remove merge conflict markers in comment.\r\n\r\n* Check for presence of atom in selection before trying to erase it.\r\n\r\n* Return Isotopologues for any root item column.\r\n\r\n* Update control widget when editing module name.\r\n\r\n* Disable controls / features in LayerTab while running.",
          "timestamp": "2022-01-05T18:31:08Z",
          "tree_id": "129d9eacbfe744ba3677a0fe7c4c645552d8c126",
