          "distinct": true,
          "id": "ff788f641f87263c8d3f2db08bed89b0d8082359",
          "message": "Patch 01/2022 (#935)\n\n* Only show intramolecular pages if necessary.\r\n\r\n* Update GUI after loading file.\r\n\r\n* Remove now-redundant GUI state file.\r\n\r\n* Update menu item names.\r\n\r\n* Display units in isotope combo texts.\r\n\r\n* Fix signalling from ModuleControlWidget.\r\n\r\n* Fix print formatting.\r\n\r\n* Set up modules after load in GUI.\r\n\r\n* Tag module setUp() output with unique name.\r\n\r\n* Remove pointless overrides.\r\n\r\n* Always createFromIsotopologues() in calculateWeights().\r\n\r\n* Add FF reference.\r\n\r\n* Correctly show main stack page when loading input file from command line.\r\n\r\n* Better updating of pair potentials in GUI (fixes #831).\r\n\r\n* Don't over-prepare CLI simulation (closes #940).\r\n\r\n* Use model in species keyword widget (closes #870).\r\n\r\n* Don't run moc on plain objects.\r\n\r\n* Fix SR parameter definitions in examples.\r\n\r\n* Harden against bad (empty) data files.\r\n\r\n* Don't stop at first error during layer setup.\r\n\r\n* Fix logic for restart file loading.\r\n\r\n* Check for presence of required data.\r\n\r\n* Always show GUI even if iterations fail.\r\n\r\n* Don't try to load restart file or perform setUp if file load fails.\r\n\r\n* Overload (don't hide) pairPotentialEnergy() function.\r\n\r\n* Formatting.\r\n\r\n* Remove unreachable code.",
          "timestamp": "2022-01-17T13:39:02Z",
          "tree_id": "0d6991b53c0281b317ac9c0db3bd72995f23309b",
          "url": "https://github.com/disorderedmaterials/dissolve/commit/ff788f641f87263c8d3f2db08bed89b0d8082359"
