          "message": "EPSR Updates (#952)\n\n* Fix storage of Gaussian coefficients.\r\n\r\n* Namespace SVD, add unit test.\r\n\r\n* Update EPSR test data.\r\n\r\n* Update EPSR inputs.\r\n\r\n* Correct serialisation of optional keywords.\r\n\r\n* Update file naming of exported data.\r\n\r\n* Add option to read inpa file.\r\n\r\n* Formatting\r\n\r\n* Better consistency with EPSR.\r\n\r\n* Initialisation order.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused var.\r\n\r\n* Fix crash when 0 < npitss < 10.\r\n\r\n* Test absolute EP energy.\r\n\r\n* Update system tests.\r\n\r\n* Increase GUI testing timeout.",
