          "distinct": true,
          "id": "a9634bdffe59d04f43b341528dfb714376fbb9d8",
          "message": "Patch 01 2022 2 (#959)\n\n* Rename tabs for clarity.\r\n\r\n* Append new module from double-click on available modules.\r\n\r\n* Return added indices, expand new indices in GUI.\r\n\r\n* Update module control widget controls after showing.\r\n\r\n* Don't disable entire simulation menu while running.\r\n\r\n* Output module name as well as type when parsing.\r\n\r\n* Obey FT limits when transforming calculated G(r).\r\n\r\n* Resize master term tables to contents.\r\n\r\n* Fix retrieval of Configurations.\r\n\r\n* Correct group name.\r\n\r\n* Add functions to remove periodic box and bonds.\r\n\r\n* Allow generation of supermolecule from CIF.\r\n\r\n* Fix system test.",
