          "id": "e91a90c91201351b828f17aa1241cf1d3143ad75",
          "message": "Patch 01 2022 3 (#960)\n\n* Revert hack to fix freetype build on Windows.\r\n\r\n* Update widget producers, better throw message.\r\n\r\n* Append displayed site name with parent species.\r\n\r\n* Fix line widths in species / selection.\r\n\r\n* Fix indexing and improve data in site atom index display.\r\n\r\n* Make site atom edits enabled but read-only.\r\n\r\n* Consistent display bracketing.\r\n\r\n* Remove unnecessary assignment.\r\n\r\n* Clarify filter flag, use bitset.\r\n\r\n* Fix site filtering in vector.\r\n\r\n* setFlag() not addFlag().",
