          "message": "Restart File UX (#1040)\n\n* Separate input and restart file loading.\r\n\r\n* Add dialog to enable choosing of restart file.\r\n\r\n* Move recent file handling to more appropriate place and do a little tidying.\r\n\r\n* Link up restart file dialog in appropriate places.\r\n\r\n* Fix state of Simulation menu.\r\n\r\n* Add menu option to set restart file frequency.\r\n\r\n* Add menu option for loading restart file data. Tidy up source a bit.\r\n\r\n* Move iterate-before-GUI code into previous conditional.",
