          "id": "650a3a91ac0912a855fc645b0322b1ebd712bd1a",
          "message": "Patch 05 2022 (#1051)\n\n* Move old workspaces icon to general_output.\r\n\r\n* Remove defunct Workspace-related actions.\r\n\r\n* Use algorithms.\r\n\r\n* Display units in table.\r\n\r\n* Add clear icon.\r\n\r\n* Rename module layer icons.\r\n\r\n* Allow clearing of single-pointer keywords.\r\n\r\n* Ensure cell contents are cleared before reinitialising.\r\n\r\n* Different status message if no simulation is loaded.\r\n\r\n* Fix availability of Stop action in Simulation menu.\r\n\r\n* Correct status label in 3D view.\r\n\r\n* Add module list to group box.\r\n\r\n* Fix generation of colours from ColourScales.\r\n\r\n* Colour distance-angle maps with HSV gradient by default.\r\n\r\n* Fix comments.\r\n\r\n* Declaration order, remove unused includes.\r\n\r\n* Clear associated module data when changing MD species targets.\r\n\r\n* Update unit test.\r\n\r\n* Move restart save option to File menu.\r\n\r\n* Tweak value checks in colourscale.\r\n\r\n* Default to feedback factor of 0.9.\r\n\r\n* Don't allow update of renderable sources while clearing module data.",
          "timestamp": "2022-05-10T20:47:13+01:00",
          "tree_id": "523b7246193b12369829670a8afd2a58422cc6a9",
