          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c0feb349025083f1d2cac5a69beef2292f2ffd14",
          "message": "Patch 05/22 Part 2 (#1059)\n\n* Avoid iterator invalidation when erasing data from GenericList.\r\n\r\n* Remove unnecessary braces from data viewer coordinate display.\r\n\r\n* Allow symmetrisation of calculated axis angle.\r\n\r\n* Update parameters and add option for symmetrisation of angle.\r\n\r\n* Correctly react to changes in node widget.\r\n\r\n* Stop the GUI crashing when clearing specific module data.\r\n\r\n* Render 2D datasets with a single y dataset correctly.\r\n\r\n* Update default calculation values.\r\n\r\n* Extend spherical shell normalisation to 2D datasets.\r\n\r\n* Make axis deltas available to OperateExppression node.\r\n\r\n* Fix distance-angle 2D normalisation in CalculateAxisAngle.\r\n\r\n* Add number density population normalisation option.\r\n\r\n* Remove clashing default args.\r\n\r\n* Correct calculation of available sites.\r\n\r\n* Reorganisation of CalculateAngle procedure and partial fix to normalisation.",
          "timestamp": "2022-05-20T22:58:37+01:00",
