          "message": "Deserialize Species (#1035)\n\n* #899: Added toml11 to the main project\r\n\r\n* #899: Intermediary commit. Need to fix CMake.\r\n\r\n* #899: Preliminary implementation of the SpeciesAtom serialize() method.\r\n\r\n* #899: Preliminary implementation of the SpeciesBond serialize() method\r\n\r\n* #899: Another preliminary set-up for including toml11\r\n\r\n* #899: Fixed the linking issue\r\n\r\n* #899: Preliminary implementation of the Species serialize method\r\n\r\n* #899: Fixed issues with the serialization process\r\n\r\n* #899: Minor code clean-up\r\n\r\n* #899: More code clean-up\r\n\r\n* #899: Minor bug fix\r\n\r\n* #899: Fixed the atom indexing\r\n\r\n* #899: Revert the previous fix\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented more of the Species serialization methods\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented more of the serialization methods.\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented some serialization for Isotopologue and Site and cleaned up the root generation\r\n\r\n* #899: Finished the implementation of the Bond serialize() method\r\n\r\n* #899: Finished the implementation of the Angle serialize() method\r\n\r\n* #899: Finalized the implementation of the Torsion serialize() method\r\n\r\n* #899: Finished the implementation of the Improper serialize() method\r\n\r\n* #899: Fixed the species class\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented the serialize() methods for Isotopologues and Sites\r\n\r\n* #899: Improved the serialization of interaction parameters\r\n\r\n* #899: Reverted the default isotopologue\r\n\r\n* #899: Initial configuration serialization method\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented the box serialization method as well as serialize methods for all master relationships\r\n\r\n* #899: Changed the output of master terms to be tables instead of lists\r\n\r\n* #899: Refined the configuration serialization code\r\n\r\n* #899: Cleaned up the MasterTerms\r\n\r\n* #899: Initial pair potentials serialization commit\r\n\r\n* #899: Implemented the pair potentials serialization\r\n\r\n* Format.\r\n\r\n* #899: Fixed CMakeLists and change the for loop within atomtype\r\n\r\n* #899: Addressed other comments raised by Adam in the PR\r\n\r\n* #1016: Initial implementation of the deserialize() methods\r\n\r\n* #1018: Initial deserialization of the PairPotentials\r\n\r\n* #1016: Weird git behaviour fix\r\n\r\n* #1016: Fixed a bug in the serialization code\r\n\r\n* Move antlr runtime issues into conan\r\n\r\n* #1016: Intermediary commit\r\n\r\n* #1016: Fixed a bug with deserializing species()\r\n\r\n* #1016: Fixed the deserialization of Impropers and Torsions\r\n\r\n* #1016: Minor bug fix in io.cpp\r\n\r\n* #1016: Added checks to see if a key exists in a file before trying to read it\r\n\r\n* #1016: Cleaned up the code a bit\r\n\r\n* #1016: More code cleaning up\r\n\r\n* #1018: Move the initial deserialization of the pair potentials to the `SerializablePairPotential` class\r\n\r\n* #1018: Preliminary implementation of the AtomType deserialize method\r\n\r\n* #1018: Added the deserialize code to io.cpp\r\n\r\n* #1018: Final implementation of the PairPotentials deserialization method\r\n\r\n* #1018: Cleaned up the code by addressing Tristan's comments on the PR.\r\n\r\n* #1018: Intermediary commit that aims to improve the testing process\r\n\r\n* #1016: Deserializing the masterTerm for each interaction\r\n\r\n* #1018: Cleaned up the formatting and renamed serialize and deserialize methods to serialise and deserialise\r\n\r\n* #1016: Cleaned the trash left behind by merging develop\r\n\r\n* #1016: Cleaned even more merge trash\r\n\r\n* #1018: Changed std::vector<std::string> to auto&\r\n\r\n* #1018: Converted another std::vector<std::string> to auto&\r\n\r\n* #1016: Cleaned more version control trash\r\n\r\n* #1016: Added forward declarations in coredata.h\r\n\r\n* Fix import loop in species and coredata\r\n\r\n* Remove vs build parts\r\n\r\n* #1016: Finalized the implementation of deserialize() methods for isotopologues and sites\r\n\r\n* #1018: Turned the flag to false\r\n\r\n* Start unit test for TOML\r\n\r\n* Simplify toml serialisation code\r\n\r\n* Fix unit test formatting\r\n\r\n* Create Serialisable class\r\n\r\n* Serialise class for SpeciesSite\r\n\r\n* Use Serialisable interface for all instances\r\n\r\n* Fix formatting\r\n\r\n* Better name for SerialisedData and serialiser.h\r\n\r\n* Factor out deserialisation for proper testing\r\n\r\n* Pass deserialisation flag by reference\r\n\r\n* Start refactoring deserialise\r\n\r\n* Start collecting master terms\r\n\r\n* Mostly working\r\n\r\n* Fix master issues\r\n\r\n* Pass basic species test\r\n\r\n* Factor out SpeciesIntra boilerplate\r\n\r\n* Combine Master deserialisation\r\n\r\n* Remove SpeciesIntra Serialisation boilerplate\r\n\r\n* Newline at end of .gitignore\r\n\r\n* Atom charge is optional\r\n\r\n* Fix formatting\r\n\r\n* Don't try to handle malformed SpeciesIntra terms\r\n\r\n* Simplify masters names\r\n\r\n* Use helper functions on SpeciesSite\r\n\r\n* Remove old testing code\r\n\r\n* Add comment lines\r\n\r\n* Less species deserialise boilerplate\r\n\r\n* Add another test case\r\n\r\n* Remove unneeded read overload.\r\n\r\n* Single constructor for Isotopologue\r\n\r\n* More Masters into private inner class\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesimproper.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesintra.h\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesintra.h\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesintra.h\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciestorsion.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/species.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/species.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/species.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/species.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesangle.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/speciesbond.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Tidy up Masters class\r\n\r\n* Single constructor with default value\r\n\r\n* Update comment\r\n\r\n* Fix formatting\r\n\r\n* Fix exception text\r\n\r\n* Masters class does not escape CoreData\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
