          "distinct": true,
          "id": "a9c828f82f3fc4e1f37a05ac69bce743dc6131a9",
          "message": "Improved CIF Import (#1082)\n\n* Fix crash when parsing empty ';' blocks in CIFs.\r\n\r\n* Return whether an element is metallic.\r\n\r\n* Control prevention of metallic bonds in CIF wizard.\r\n\r\n* Fix application of CIF bonding.\r\n\r\n* Allow optional copy of atom types.\r\n\r\n* Move moiety removal to new page (Clean Structure).\r\n\r\n* Fix initialisation order.\r\n\r\n* Allow multiple / zero groups to be active within an assembly.\r\n\r\n* Expand assemblies tree on show.\r\n\r\n* Add ability to remove water or coordinated oxygen.",
          "timestamp": "2022-05-27T21:15:34+01:00",
