          "message": "Configuration & PairPotentials (#1099)\n\n* Don't generate configurations all the time.\r\n\r\n* Check for valid pp in model, return empty string when charge is irrelevant.\r\n\r\n* Set zero charges in PairPotential when using species atom source.\r\n\r\n* Check absolute value of configuration total charge.\r\n\r\n* Tidy up pair potential generation functions.\r\n\r\n* Better update of pair potential table and graph.\r\n\r\n* Generate pair potentials before (and after) Configuration generation.",
