          "id": "e4f5d97c9341bcce85a21d07a5ed316d7e98b301",
          "message": "Move ANTLR to where macqtdeploy can find it (#1079)\n\n* Move ANTLR to where macqtdeploy can find it\r\n\r\n* Use brew to install jq on mac\r\n\r\n* Only build on Mac while we fix this\r\n\r\n* Don't build linux releases until we're ready\r\n\r\n* No whitespace in bash variable assignment\r\n\r\n* Can't dummy out yaml templates\r\n\r\n* Add closing quote hen calculating Antlr hash\r\n\r\n* Get bash to set antlr hash from command result\r\n\r\n* Try and get permission to update libraries\r\n\r\n* Try and link in ANTLR on Mac the polite way\r\n\r\n* Correct binary path\r\n\r\n* Try again with install_name_tool\r\n\r\n* Can we just disable mac security on the CI server?\r\n\r\n* Try copying to /usr/local/lib\r\n\r\n* Remove install_name_tool code\r\n\r\n* Turn off mac gui for faster build\r\n\r\n* Pull from my script fork\r\n\r\n* We have to build the Mac GUI for these tests\r\n\r\n* Add local lib to prep-dmg library path\r\n\r\n* Also pull in TBB dependency on Mac\r\n\r\n* Remove version from TBB copy on Mac\r\n\r\n* Move to shared TBB\r\n\r\n* Try and fix rpath for tbb on Mac\r\n\r\n* Add RPATH\r\n\r\n* Remove testing changes",
