          "message": "Patch - June 2022, Part 2 (#1103)\n\n* Generalise version-specific deserialisation from v0.8.9 to v0.8.X.\r\n\r\n* Set enabled status of new menu item.\r\n\r\n* Initialisation order.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused variable and function.\r\n\r\n* Reject existing velocities if vector size differs.\r\n\r\n* Ensure pair potentials are available when generating configurations.\r\n\r\n* Don't check before generation if configuration is currently empty, and rename widget for consistency.",
