          "distinct": true,
          "id": "445624216136413045f0ecff75fa7261d446b154",
          "message": "Patch - June 2022, Part 3 (#1117)\n\n* Remember last value in Run For dialog.\r\n\r\n* Show total configuration charges when non-neutral.\r\n\r\n* Fix crash when showing EPSR/Potentials tab when no pairpotentials are defined.\r\n\r\n* Correctly handle keyword signal for renderable recreation.\r\n\r\n* Show box for periodic species.\r\n\r\n* Simplify label update.\r\n\r\n* Fix creation of template species.\r\n\r\n* Add missing File keyword for CoordinateSets.\r\n\r\n* Fix name of SelectionPopulation enum.\r\n\r\n* Fix and improve example packaging.\r\n\r\n* Non-zero charges aren't necessarily errors.\r\n\r\n* Option to use archive source for FreeType.",
          "timestamp": "2022-06-13T16:22:55+01:00",
