          "id": "500e7b12b3e9f6682b7e62251b6b211cdb63d1b5",
          "message": "Nix 22.05 upgrade (#1114)\n\n* Update to Nixos 22.05\r\n\r\n* Try to move to modern QEMU code\r\n\r\n* Remove Old Qt DIR code\r\n\r\n* Patch qt6\r\n\r\n* Remove dead nix code\r\n\r\n* Better overlay usage\r\n\r\n* Only hook in desktop on GUI build\r\n\r\n* Add flake access to push to cachix\r\n\r\n* Don't use request declarative\r\n\r\nWe never use it\r\n\r\n* qt6 deps gets automatically found by hook\r\n\r\n* Better filtering of source directories\r\n\r\n* try adding qtdeclarative directly\r\n\r\n* Keep old singularity for the time being\r\n\r\n* Add raspberry-pi support",
