          "message": "Patch 07/22 (#1203)\n\n* Don't store legacy data in map.\r\n\r\n* Add option to save original g(r).\r\n\r\n* Update docs.\r\n\r\n* Tweak title in LigParGen import wizard.\r\n\r\n* Use local var.\r\n\r\n* Initialisation order.\r\n\r\n* Don't crash when layer frequency is explicitly set to zero.\r\n\r\n* Fix naming of written totals.\r\n\r\n* Set correct box action when using fixed size.\r\n\r\n* Fix group box text.",
