          "id": "7949e91f157afa766f36f364a6f800d65467b75d",
          "message": "CIF Upgrades (#1202)\n\n* Simplify error return.\r\n\r\n* Fix element detection for strings with appended integers.\r\n\r\n* Capture error.\r\n\r\n* Detect elements from site types if site symbol not present.\r\n\r\n* Tidy / simplify symmetry operator generation.\r\n\r\n* Const loop var.\r\n\r\n* Use operator.\r\n\r\n* Remove dead code.\r\n\r\n* Add bool tag search.\r\n\r\n* Namespace space groups info, provide additional symbol data, simplify usage.\r\n\r\n* Add unit test.\r\n\r\n* Allow space group to be overridden manually, and don't bail if it can't be found.\r\n\r\n* Remove dead code.\r\n\r\n* Simplify page, and space group is still two words.",
          "timestamp": "2022-08-03T11:48:05+01:00",
