          "id": "a520047d015d1ee011249600879bb7a8a711767e",
          "message": "Procedure Editing - Part 3 (#1182)\n\n* Tidy isotopologue model.\r\n\r\n* Simplify parentage in ProcedureNode heirarchy, returning based on scope.\r\n\r\n* Turn ProcedureModel into a tree.\r\n\r\n* Set block keyword rather than block termination keyword in Procedure and Sequence node.\r\n\r\n* Display context in model.\r\n\r\n* Function naming (serialise over write).\r\n\r\n* Fix comment typo.\r\n\r\n* Consistency of node name / type order.\r\n\r\n* Consistent use of QString::arg(), return pointer data from context column.\r\n\r\n* Fix nasty range mismatch crashes.\r\n\r\n* Update unit test.\r\n\r\n* Update src/gui/models/isotopologueSetModel.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
          "timestamp": "2022-08-11T12:01:21+01:00",
