          "id": "56007f621282f2fa6d696f2bb12657a60f24d25a",
          "message": "Procedure Editing - Part 4 (#1224)\n\n* Return shared_ptr for root sequence.\r\n\r\n* Constify node ref arguments.\r\n\r\n* Merge node getters.\r\n\r\n* Check for node in scope when validating.\r\n\r\n* Return success on keyword set, and validate node-based keywords.\r\n\r\n* Add consistency check function.\r\n\r\n* Remove defunct node-related source files.\r\n\r\n* Merge / rename parameter search / retrieval functions.\r\n\r\n* Set NodeValueKeyword via KeywordStore.\r\n\r\n* Add unit test.\r\n\r\n* Don't store unnecessary Procedure pointer in SequenceNode.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused (and still containing legacy keyword stuff) Fit1D node.\r\n\r\n* Refactor SequenceProcedureNode into non-node ProcedureNodeSequence class.\r\n\r\n* Remove children(), use branch() instead.\r\n\r\n* Store (optional) reference to owner.\r\n\r\n* Fix GUI unit test.\r\n\r\n* Add extra check.",
