          "distinct": true,
          "id": "654cdb4d197526a980520396731c0af3a2d6447a",
          "message": "Procedure Editing - Part 5 (#1225)\n\n* Add model for node palette.\r\n\r\n* Add procedure model mime data class.\r\n\r\n* Implement dragging of new nodes from palette.\r\n\r\n* Implement node internal move.\r\n\r\n* Pass explicit invalid QModelIndex to force correct behaviour.\r\n\r\n* Fix internal move between scopes.\r\n\r\n* Fix move of items within same scope.\r\n\r\n* Add mechanism to validate keywords storing ProcedureNode data.\r\n\r\n* Update Procedure keyword data after change.\r\n\r\n* Allow exclusion of specific node in search.\r\n\r\n* Rename nodes via model.\r\n\r\n* Update unit test.\r\n\r\n* Update src/gui/models/procedureModel.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Use switch.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
          "timestamp": "2022-09-20T12:43:22+01:00",
