          "id": "b3f55b5b58db95b2a297ca7fe5ca85f30f1c1b0b",
          "message": "Patch 09/2022 (#1242)\n\n* Adjust layout of box in ConfigurationTab.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused includes.\r\n\r\n* Adjust font size button style.\r\n\r\n* Show any file in dialogs.\r\n\r\n* Adjust layout of box in SpeciesTab.\r\n\r\n* Update isotopologues table when manually-assigning atom types.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused function.\r\n\r\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Overrides are public too.\r\n\r\n* Update module list on enable/disable via tabbar.\r\n\r\n* Allow Q-dependent broadening of intra RDF.\r\n\r\n* Remove old file.\r\n\r\n* Fix crash on update of EPSR pair potentials tab.\r\n\r\n* Clarify / simplify moving average window length.\r\n\r\n* Reintroduce optional smoothing of fluctuation coefficients.\r\n\r\n* Update system tests.",
