          "id": "75a79e6ae41e163608bd941d6494f1b6feae370e",
          "message": "NETA Paths (#1249)\n\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Clarify error messages.\r\n\r\n* Make NETANode into a more useful base class.\r\n\r\n* Allow bracketed sub-sequencing of nodes.\r\n\r\n* Update unit test.\r\n\r\n* Add ring atom matches to path, simplify return logic.\r\n\r\n* Update NETA in ffs to put ring definitions last.\r\n\r\n* Tidy connection node and ensure full path is stored.\r\n\r\n* Add function to return path of matched definition.\r\n\r\n* Fix forcefield ring matching.\r\n\r\n* Adjust type descriptions.\r\n\r\n* Refactor ring atom code.\r\n\r\n* Move to ordered ring matching.\r\n\r\n* Use std::optional in bound count node.\r\n\r\n* Use std::optional in hydrogen count node.\r\n\r\n* Use std::optional in ring node.\r\n\r\n* Remove pointless NETA root node.",
