          "message": "Scattering matrix inversion (#1275)\n\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Better checking for zero value denominators.\r\n\r\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Reorganise loop for speed.\r\n\r\n* Fix typos.\r\n\r\n* Make ScatteringMatrix a member variable of module, and init in setUp().\r\n\r\n* Only add / update data as necessary.\r\n\r\n* Better comment.\r\n\r\n* Clearer variable name.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused functions.\r\n\r\n* Function returning whether Q-dependent inversions are required.\r\n\r\n* Precalculate matrices for relevant Q values.\r\n\r\n* Use precalculated Q = 0.0 matrix inverse.",
