          "id": "5589f39b1b8292f80a4c5514e256db6bef3c4836",
          "message": "1125 Dynamic Sites (#1288)\n\n* SpeciesSite can be different types.\r\n\r\n* Clarify return of modifiable vs unmodifiable selected atoms from species.\r\n\r\n* Centralise test species data.\r\n\r\n* Don't leak memory.\r\n\r\n* Tidy main class a little.\r\n\r\n* Allow basic definition of elements for dynamic sites.\r\n\r\n* Function to return species population from configuration.\r\n\r\n* Split stack creation function.\r\n\r\n* Generate dynamic sites based on elements.\r\n\r\n* Add system test.\r\n\r\n* Add unit test.\r\n\r\n* Do the same for atom types.\r\n\r\n* Return vector of sites when creating from parent.\r\n\r\n* TOML I/O.\r\n\r\n* More unit testing.\r\n\r\n* Remove keyword and procedure node related to old dynamic site specification.\r\n\r\n* Update system test.",
