          "distinct": true,
          "id": "585aefdbd2f2be66be9a2574710e51851064f33d",
          "message": "1274 Interpolation over full array speed increase (#1302)\n\n* setting up initial test parameters for benchmark\r\n\r\n* formatting errors fixed and comments added\r\n\r\n* Fix Interpolator declaration\r\n\r\n* Add Interpolator benchmark\r\n\r\n* Add helper script for adjusting CPU settings while running benchmarks\r\n\r\n* Move y function\r\n\r\n* Move robuest benchmark script\r\n\r\n* reformat Interpolator benchmark\r\n\r\n* moved double y(double x) logic to new function\r\n\r\n* double Interpolator::y(double x, int interval) included in new function\r\n\r\n* Cache Workflow (#1304)\r\n\r\n* Add manually-run cache workflow.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused CACHIX_AUTH_TOKEN.\r\n\r\n* Single cache for all nix builds.\r\n\r\n* Nix Import / Export (#1307)\r\n\r\n* Try using nix-store import/export.\r\n\r\n* Fix glaring errors.\r\n\r\n* const xs reference\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/math/interpolator.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* changed ifs to switch and added in a clarifying comment\r\n\r\n* 1295 Finalise GitHub Actions (#1303)\r\n\r\n* Use exactly the same path specs.\r\n\r\n* Conan caching for OSX, and move to separate step.\r\n\r\n* Debug windows packaging.\r\n\r\n* Add publishing stage, add Linux packaging.\r\n\r\n* Fix OSX conan stuff.\r\n\r\n* Attempt linux packaging.\r\n\r\n* Switch nix logic, making non-gui the default.\r\n\r\n* Always Release mode.\r\n\r\n* Test - always enable building of checks?\r\n\r\n* Different approach.\r\n\r\n* Use bash properly.\r\n\r\n* Remove extra builds.\r\n\r\n* Add kvm to nix system-features.\r\n\r\n* Fix Linux build/test/packaging.\r\n\r\n* Ignore paths in PR workflow.\r\n\r\n* Tidy, remove unnecessary stuff.\r\n\r\n* Don't use fancy bash.\r\n\r\n* More windows fixing.\r\n\r\n* More Linux stuff (tidy nix store before cache).\r\n\r\n* Don't quote when you need a glob!\r\n\r\n* Update .github/workflows/build/linux/action.yml\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Module Bits (#1298)\r\n\r\n* Remove extraneous configuration name argument from fmt calls when citing renderables.\r\n\r\n* Fix display of coordination numbers.\r\n\r\n* setting up initial test parameters for benchmark\r\n\r\n* formatting errors fixed and comments added\r\n\r\n* Fix Interpolator declaration\r\n\r\n* Add Interpolator benchmark\r\n\r\n* Add helper script for adjusting CPU settings while running benchmarks\r\n\r\n* Move y function\r\n\r\n* Move robuest benchmark script\r\n\r\n* moved double y(double x) logic to new function\r\n\r\n* reformat Interpolator benchmark\r\n\r\n* double Interpolator::y(double x, int interval) included in new function\r\n\r\n* const xs reference\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Update src/math/interpolator.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* changed ifs to switch and added in a clarifying comment\r\n\r\n* doubles changed to autos\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>",
