          "id": "f2bd9c9e7d6a056fd87f22a5284326dd4aafd204",
          "message": "1309 Intramolecular Distance Module (#1320)\n\n* Copy SiteRDF module.\r\n\r\n* Rename files, adjust CMake targets.\r\n\r\n* Rename classes.\r\n\r\n* It's a distance histogram, not an RDF.\r\n\r\n* Don't forget to add the producer!\r\n\r\n* And don't forget the widget producer either.\r\n\r\n* Morph into distance histogram calculation.\r\n\r\n* Update analysis test data.\r\n\r\n* Add intradistance system test.\r\n\r\n* Remove some old member variables.\r\n\r\n* Add manual page.\r\n\r\n* Add placeholder module icon.\r\n\r\n* Remove unnecessary file.",
