          "message": "calculateexpression node for expressions as quantities (#1381)\n\n* added calculatedistanceexpression node\r\n\r\n* changes suggested made, renamed to calclateexpression\r\n\r\n* format changes\r\n\r\n* fixed keyword and added in NodeType\r\n\r\n* added calculateexpression to CMake lists\r\n\r\n* Match execute() to override ProcedureNodeBase virtual.\r\n\r\n* Add new node to master header.\r\n\r\n* Don't need initialisation braces.\r\n\r\n* Make expression_ a private member and add a description.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused forward declaration.\r\n\r\n* Move existing procedure unit test to own directory, add new one for CalculateExpression.\r\n\r\n* renamed to caluclateexpressionprocdurenode and changed execute\r\n\r\n* format change\r\n\r\n* error fix\r\n\r\n* unit procudure fixed\r\n\r\n* value_ changed and bracers deleted for expression\r\n\r\n* Extend unit test.\r\n\r\n* unit test for expression\r\n\r\n* quotes added to expression\r\n\r\n* format change\r\n\r\n* c++ is radians not degrees\r\n\r\n* format\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Tristan Youngs <tristan.youngs@stfc.ac.uk>",
