          "id": "559aa06608b66633e792165c9441de838b154648",
          "message": "Kernel Tidying (1398 pt 1) (#1401)\n\n* Remove pointless declarations.\r\n\r\n* Remove old and unused ScaledEnergyKernel.\r\n\r\n* Make functions const, fix function description.\r\n\r\n* Remove unused functions.\r\n\r\n* Remove unnecessary function argument.\r\n\r\n* Rename some functions for clarity.\r\n\r\n* Reorganise and simplify ForceKernel, moving functions from ForcesModule.\r\n\r\n* Control force calculation via enum to reduce code dup.\r\n\r\n* Clarify unbound/bound vs inter/intra.\r\n\r\n* Remove more unused functions.\r\n\r\n* Harmonise EnergyKernel ctor with ForceKernel ctor.\r\n\r\n* Add new unit test and test data.\r\n\r\n* Update benchmarks.\r\n\r\n* Fix assertion.",
          "timestamp": "2023-05-02T09:08:30+01:00",
