          "id": "99df909682985d1f69db40eaff3d1b4d8de1a0cb",
          "message": "No Atom Array Indexing (#1398 pt 5) (#1414)\n\n* Remove requirement for AtomChangeToken.\r\n\r\n* Clarify update routines.\r\n\r\n* Remove storage of atom indices in Cells.\r\n\r\n* Tidy Cell class.\r\n\r\n* Remove trivial arrayIndex() use from Cell::addAtom().\r\n\r\n* Remove need for arrayIndex and storage of indices in Molecule upkeep.\r\n\r\n* Remove trivial arrayIndex use from RegionalDistributor.\r\n\r\n* Clarify force calculation enumerations.\r\n\r\n* Simplify main force calculation routine.\r\n\r\n* Calculate global atom indices.\r\n\r\n* Update geometry kernel.\r\n\r\n* Update test forces calculation.\r\n\r\n* Remove Atom::arrayIndex().\r\n\r\n* Update src/classes/molecule.cpp\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>\r\n\r\n* Use algorithm.\r\n\r\n* Undeleting storage of the global atom offset.\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Adam Washington <adam.washington@stfc.ac.uk>",
