          "message": "Access Node Data (#1413)\n\n* Allow CalculateExpression nodes to be produced.\r\n\r\n* Actually display the input string when showing parse errors.\r\n\r\n* Fix CalculateExpressionNode::execute().\r\n\r\n* Allow setName to be overloaded, add parameter renaming function.\r\n\r\n* Update SelectNode to have its own parameters and rename them on node name change.\r\n\r\n* Allow variable names with dots in.\r\n\r\n* Fix typo.\r\n\r\n* Direct setting of contained Expression for convenience & clarity.\r\n\r\n* Update unit test.",
