          "distinct": true,
          "id": "9a55ac04d87eeaecb4fe29f528e99dce969d71b3",
          "message": "Regions and Removals (#1423)\n\n* Don't keep generating regions.\r\n\r\n* Throw an exception when it really should be an exception.\r\n\r\n* Check for valid region_ in prepare() rather than execute().\r\n\r\n* Don't try to update cell locations if the CellArray hasn't been initialised.\r\n\r\n* Update object relationships after removing / copying molecules in procedures.\r\n\r\n* Clear CellArray when empty()-ing.\r\n\r\n* De-parent Atoms before removing them from the array en masse.\r\n\r\n* Tidy benchmarks.\r\n\r\n* Add region benchmarking.",
          "timestamp": "2023-05-31T20:30:10+01:00",
